  "whyTopTier": "A 41 s film that follows one document, a PRD for 'Bundled delivery at checkout', through its life: written with collaborators, filled from a data source by prompt, commented on, laid beside mobile designs, then handed to a coding agent as context. Named multiplayer cursors are in almost every shot.",
  "instrument": "24 fps. One long move, a 1.8 s scroll down the table (6.12), and a drag (20.80); both sit next to cuts. The one fit that runs is loose (rms 11%) and is not counted. Dissolves run up to 2.4 s.",
